= Second National Conference of the anti-war Social Democratic Opposition

The second national conference of the anti-war Social Democratic opposition, with 124 delegates and 15 members of the Reichstag, is held in Gotha. Hugo Haase, of the SPD and Georg Ledebour are elected chairmen of the newly formed USPD.

We have agreed to join the USPD on the condition that we are politically independent. 

